# Jill, Shiva's Dominant and Shiva, Warden of Ice, the whole cycle. Jill is cast on turn 1 with three Moxen (no target for her enters trigger);
# on turn 3 {3}{U}{U}, {T} is paid exactly with Black Lotus (UUU), Mox Sapphire and Mox Jet. She is exiled and returns as Shiva, a 4/5 blue
# Saga creature (CR 712.14a, 714.3a) with a lore counter: chapter I makes the Memnite unblockable; on turn 5 chapter II does the same;
# on turn 7 chapter III (CR 714.2c) taps every land Bot2 controls - Bot1's own Island stays untapped - and exiles Shiva, who comes back
# front face up as a new Jill (CR 400.7) with no lore counter, and her enters trigger returns Bot2's Ornithopter to its hand.

